    "displayName": "High Risk Shipment Recovery",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Recover Cargo\nApproval code: = [ApprovalCode]\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nGot a transport in need of backup over at [Location]. Signal was patchy, but their comms made it sound like a group of outlaws had gotten wind of what they were hauling and attempted to take it from them.\n\nConsidering the state of things before we lost contact, I'm considering this a recovery mission. Multiple hostiles are expected at the site, so a skilled crew is crucial for the success of this operation. There will be a high volume of cargo to deal with, so a ship that can carry [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers and a heavy-duty tractor beam will be needed. \n\nUpon successful extraction of cargo, deliver to the freight elevator at [Destination].\n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.",
